OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMostly
OL,6,Fcloudy with a few passing showers this
OL,7,Fevening, mainly across Argyll. Showery
OL,8,Frain across Argyll overnight with
OL,9,Ffreshening southwesterly winds. Mainly
OL,10,Fdry with clear periods elsewhere.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FA rather cloudy day with
OL,13,Fspells of rain across Argyll. Drier
OL,14,Felsewhere with a few brief showers.
OL,15,FFresh southwesterly wind across Argyll.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FCloudy
OL,18,Fon Saturday with spells of rain, most
OL,19,Fpersistent across Argyll. Patchy rain
OL,20,Fat first on Sunday then dry. Dry on
OL,21,FMonday.
